{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062180/extras/9e855cf7cffdb2130d72102a5b5eeb53.avif?t=1760577734\" width=600 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampdoll: The Blood-Drinking Maidens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...They are girls who can only survive by drinking the blood of other girls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To exterminate the monstrous beings known as &quot;Werewolves&quot;, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they fight as part of the Imperial Army's Special Assault Unit,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >code-named &quot;Dog Killers: the Stray Dog Carnag&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As their &quot;rations&quot;, they are provided with girls known as &quot;Bride Thorns&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a &quot;yuri&quot; girls' love story, where you witness the emotions between girls who have become vampires and their human partners. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What endings will they each choose...?</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the demo version of <i>The Vampire\u2019s Bride: The Novel Game</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a visual novel where you can experience a heartfelt love story between girls, accompanied by beautiful illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo covers the prologue of the story, offering about 30 minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in the full version, you can also revisit unlocked CGs and reread the story through the built-in replay features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The era is Meiji. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sana Shirafuji, who lost her grandmother and is left alone in the world, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >knocks on the military's door to become a &quot;Bride Thorn&quot; to make a living. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;Bride Thorn&quot; is a &quot;ration&quot; for girls known as &quot;Vampdolls&quot;, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >who are specialized in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unaware of this, Sana accepts the military contract out of desperation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On her first day of enlistment, she meets </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yukine Hanafusa, a beautiful yet disdainful Vampdoll. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually, Sana and Yukine begin to understand each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the first night of blood drinking, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they discover that the act of drinking blood brings physical and emotional exhilaration. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite their awkwardness, they experience their first blood drinking together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some time later, Yukine becomes incapacitated during a certain operation... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sana Shirafuji\u00a0 Voiced by Hime Sawada<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062180/extras/4182b16cbfcbe6e5151ada98e8f6212b.avif?t=1760577734\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Yukine Hanafusa\u00a0 Voiced by Rui Tanabe<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062180/extras/3109880acc2e5e18dd5f61dc33df0e4d.avif?t=1760577734\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Ao Shinokura\u00a0 Voiced by Yuuka Aisaka<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akama